{
  "_sample": "Stage 4 — Blueprint Assembly output. The CompositionSpec IS the edit: a layer-by-layer stitch instruction. BOS builds this JSON; a render provider (FFmpeg / Shotstack / Creatomate) composites the layers. AI-generated plates and brand assets are SEPARATE files referenced by asset_id; brand colors/fonts are referenced by slot and resolved from the Brand Kit at render time. Switching render_provider does not change this document.",
